    "detailed_description": "Visit the world's largest airplane graveyard and explore the huge desert filled with wrecks. Hundreds of tons of steel and rusted electronics are waiting. Dismantle airplanes, earn money from scrap, and complete tasks from your employer! Cut, hit, dismantle, and assemble new airplanes, growing your business along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISMANTLE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cut through airplane fuselages, dismantle frames, and search for valuable components like pilot cockpits that you can use to complete tasks. Use lifts to access hard-to-reach parts of the airplanes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCRAP</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Deliver fuselage and structural components of airplanes to the scrapyard for processing. Use vehicles for transport and earn money at the scrapyard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/b9e3d1956c8d1c0cb9093b4a49e96dc9.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/b9e3d1956c8d1c0cb9093b4a49e96dc9.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/b9e3d1956c8d1c0cb9093b4a49e96dc9.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your office is your home. Manage orders and discover new missions. Complete tasks within the specified time frame, enriching yourself in the process. Grow your business by investing in new airplanes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISMANTLING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/69b7afc2246e184bc73cd57ae7a8bd67.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/69b7afc2246e184bc73cd57ae7a8bd67.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/69b7afc2246e184bc73cd57ae7a8bd67.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Complete complex tasks such as recovering engines and valuable electronics. Remember, engines are expensive equipment and hasty actions can result in lost orders and money!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR BUSINESS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e73f884bb2d4725b33e10174905aebe7.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e73f884bb2d4725b33e10174905aebe7.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e73f884bb2d4725b33e10174905aebe7.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Grow your business by purchasing new airplanes for refurbishment. Invest in new hangars and become a monopoly in the airplane graveyard industry.",
    "about_the_game": "Visit the world's largest airplane graveyard and explore the huge desert filled with wrecks. Hundreds of tons of steel and rusted electronics are waiting. Dismantle airplanes, earn money from scrap, and complete tasks from your employer! Cut, hit, dismantle, and assemble new airplanes, growing your business along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISMANTLE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/e3395137eebde52ee6d21b7b7c633ddd.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cut through airplane fuselages, dismantle frames, and search for valuable components like pilot cockpits that you can use to complete tasks. Use lifts to access hard-to-reach parts of the airplanes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCRAP</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.poster.avif?t=1743592368\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.webm?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128610/extras/5222b48b4ad63028fe2284ee30acf39c.mp4?t=1743592368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Deliver fuselage and structural components of airplanes to the scrapyard for processing. Use vehicles for transport and earn money at the scra